Subject: [PATCH 09/17] CameraDeviceUserShim: stub the batched
 updateOutputConfigurations

ICameraDeviceUser gained a batched updateOutputConfigurations(int[],
OutputConfiguration[]) method alongside the existing single-stream
updateOutputConfiguration(int, OutputConfiguration), which the legacy
camera HALv1 shim restored by the camera patches doesn't implement.
Add a no-op stub matching the existing one, since neither is
implemented for legacy HALv1 devices.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I982f9c3452b55dc2a202bc9d09ac38a89217d4c9
---
 .../hardware/camera2/legacy/CameraDeviceUserShim.java        | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

